---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Section id="about" label="01 — About" title="Backend is where I live">
  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12">
    <div
      class="reveal space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-lg lg:col-span-2"
    >
      <p>
        I'm a backend developer with <span class="text-ink">4+ years</span> of
        experience designing and shipping scalable, high-performance systems. My
        core stack is <span class="font-medium text-accent">Go</span> and
        <span class="font-medium text-accent-2">PHP</span>, where I build
        microservices and APIs that stay fast and reliable under heavy,
        real-world traffic.
      </p>
      <p>
        I work across the whole backend lifecycle — from clean, well-tested
        domain code (Clean Architecture, TDD/BDD) to cloud infrastructure and
        deployments on <span class="text-ink">Kubernetes, Helm, and AWS</span>.
        Today I'm part of the engineering team behind
        <a
          href={site.currentProductUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="font-medium text-ink underline decoration-accent/50 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-accent"
          >{site.currentProduct}</a
        >, one of the world's leading luxury-fashion e-commerce platforms.
      </p>
      <p>
        I care about reliability, maintainability, and continuously sharpening my
        craft — and I'm always happy to dig into a hard scaling problem.
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside
      class="reveal ring-gradient relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl p-6"
    >
      <div
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="absolute -right-10 -top-10 size-32 rounded-full bg-[rgba(34,211,238,0.18)] blur-2xl"
      >
      </div>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">
        Currently
      </p>
      <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">{site.role}</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">
        @ {site.currentCompany} ·
        <a
          href={site.currentProductUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="text-accent hover:underline">{site.currentProduct}</a
        >
      </p>

      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm text-muted">
        <li class="flex gap-2.5">
          <span class="mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
          High-performance microservices in Go
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2.5">
          <span class="mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
          Cloud infra on Kubernetes, Helm &amp; AWS
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2.5">
          <span class="mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
          Scaling a high-traffic luxury marketplace
        </li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Section>
